        <mxCell id="v119" value="&lt;b&gt;ESCALATED · intent mismatch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;dashboard renders an &lt;b&gt;independent fetch&lt;/b&gt; of the checkout page beside the constraint. TTL 5 min → &lt;b&gt;auto-deny&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Does not stop a lying agent — stated limitation.&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#C8A415;fontColor=#5C4708;" vertex="1" parent="1">
